id: pm-63i8nr
title: Diagnose abandoned build leases before the full acquisition timeout
description: A dead build owner can leave a lease that makes bootstrap wait silently until timeout. Report recorded owner liveness and actionable recovery guidance promptly without age-based lock stealing or removal of live leases.
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-20T13:15:17.233Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-21T10:47:46.671Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-21T10:47:45.861Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-21T10:47:45.861Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Dead owner diagnostics identify the lease and safe recovery path; live and permission-ambiguous owners remain protected; independent-process tests cover both outcomes
parent: pm-u9d0
resolution: "Build acquisition diagnoses an absent owner only after valid PID/token parsing and an unchanged reread, preserving all ambiguous receipts and never deleting a lease automatically."
expected_result: "Abandoned ownership produces prompt actionable diagnostics while live, malformed, permission-ambiguous and replaced ownership remains protected."
actual_result: Real independent-process abandonment and competing-producer tests pass; invalid-token negative controls refuse diagnosis; linked tests and 153 focused follow-up tests pass.
